flow "Invoice Processing"
direction top-to-bottom

Inbox -> Extract: new invoice
Extract -> Validate: parsed fields
Validate -> Approve: valid
Validate -> Review: exception
Review -> Validate: corrected
Approve -> Ledger: post
Ledger -> Archive: retained

group Automation: Inbox, Extract, Validate
group Finance: Review, Approve, Ledger
group Records: Archive
highlight Validate
